  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JFF7vxPq/Lios-Outlandish-Village-1.png\" alt=\"Lios-Outlandish-Village-1\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">探索一个隐藏在郁郁葱葱山丘中的迷人夏尔风格村庄，这里充满了温馨的家和活泼的居民。探索光线美丽的洞穴内部，在山顶的池塘边放松身心，并留意一个秘密按钮&mdash;&mdash;找到它即可解锁这些村民隐藏的宝藏库！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Gf1cvJrc/hobbit-hill-village1.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village1\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hF2zfm5S/hobbit-hill-village2.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village2\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/JwN8ntsg/hobbit-hill-village3.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village3\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cX8w2qp6/hobbit-hill-village4.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village4\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6c5wbRss/hobbit-hill-village5.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village5\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LDk5N4F0/hobbit-hill-village6.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village6\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zWJBBNpj/hobbit-hill-village7.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village7\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8n706pcv/hobbit-hill-village8.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village8\" border=\"0\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3554tgPC/hobbit-hill-village9.png\" alt=\"hobbit-hill-village9\" border=\"0\">\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vC3r8VSc/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"449\" height=\"41\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>本模组不会覆盖现有的原版村庄，因此可与任何其他村庄重做模组（如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lios-overhauled-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Lio's Overhauled Villages</a>）兼容！作为新系列的一部分，Lio's Outlandish Villages 旨在带来风格独特的城镇和充满冒险精神的建筑供玩家探索！</em></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/m5LGyB8T/morefromthisseries.png\" alt=\"morefromthisseries\" width=\"586\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spiral-tower-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qLJcs1SQ/spiral-towers.png\" alt=\"spiral-towers\" width=\"376\" height=\"62\" border=\"0\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 14px 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" style=\"display:block; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.35;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: inherit;\">需要基于数据包配置？</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        查看 <strong>LioLoader</strong> 以实现全局数据包/资源包加载。适用于 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong> 的 <strong>NeoForge</strong> 和 <strong>Fabric</strong>。\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: inherit; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 4px;\">前往 Modrinth 查看 LioLoader →</div>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>剧透</summary>\n<p>-評論於 11:59-<br><iframe title=\"TOP 15 NEW Minecraft Mods Of The Month! (1.21.8 to 1.20.1) | July\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rM1fSI28POk?start=719\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/pGkUmgGcsY\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/hJvQHRN5/usageinmodpacks.png\" alt=\"usageinmodpacks\" width=\"573\" height=\"39\" border=\"0\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">欢迎将<strong>夏尔山丘村庄</strong>包含在您选择的任何 Minecraft 整合包中。我们鼓励您通过将这些结构融入自定义整合包中来构建独特且引人入胜的冒险体验。无需请求许可&mdash;&mdash;只需按照您的喜好探索和享受这些村庄吧！</p>",
